COMMENT ON COLUMN IAS20261.IAS_V_NY_P_REQUEST_DETAIL.DOC_SEQUENCE IS '2767 -  ”·”· «·Õ—ﬂ…';

COMMENT ON COLUMN IAS20261.IAS_V_NY_P_REQUEST_DETAIL.CMP_NO IS '1583 - —ﬁ„ «·‘—ﬂ…';

COMMENT ON COLUMN IAS20261.IAS_V_NY_P_REQUEST_DETAIL.BRN_NO IS '50 - —ﬁ„ «·›—⁄';

