COMMENT ON COLUMN IAS20261.IAS_V_PO_WTH_PI_QTY.DOC_SEQUENCE IS '2767 -  ”·”· «·Õ—ﬂ…';

COMMENT ON COLUMN IAS20261.IAS_V_PO_WTH_PI_QTY.W_CODE IS '193 - —ﬁ„ «·„Œ“‰';

COMMENT ON COLUMN IAS20261.IAS_V_PO_WTH_PI_QTY.I_PRICE IS '230 - «·”⁄—';

COMMENT ON COLUMN IAS20261.IAS_V_PO_WTH_PI_QTY.CC_CODE IS '728 - „—ﬂ“ «· ﬂ·›…';

COMMENT ON COLUMN IAS20261.IAS_V_PO_WTH_PI_QTY.PJ_NO IS '2452 - —ﬁ„ «·„‘—Ê⁄';

