COMMENT ON COLUMN IAS20261.ARS_V_CST_SAL_DOC.DOC_DATE IS '1137 -  «—ÌŒ «·ÊÀÌﬁ…';

COMMENT ON COLUMN IAS20261.ARS_V_CST_SAL_DOC.REF_NO IS '143 - —ﬁ„ «·„—Ã⁄';

