COMMENT ON COLUMN IAS20261.IAS_V_DIFF_PI_INCOM.ACTV_NO IS '2241 - —ﬁ„ «·‰‘«ÿ';

COMMENT ON COLUMN IAS20261.IAS_V_DIFF_PI_INCOM.RCRD_NO IS '1971 - —ﬁ„ «·”Ã·';

